@startuml architecture_overview
title catkit2 - system architecture overview

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "Testbed server process" {
    [Testbed\n(catkit2.testbed.testbed)] as TB
    [Log ZmqDistributor] as LogDist
    [Tracing ZmqDistributor] as TraceDist
    [Config (YAML)] as Cfg
}

node "Service process 1 (hardware)" {
    [Service subclass\n(e.g. CameraService)] as Svc1
    [Server (ZMQ REP)] as Srv1
    [DataStreams\n(images, temperature,\nheartbeat, state)] as DS1
}

node "Service process 2 (simulator)" {
    [Simulator service] as Svc2
    [OpticalModel] as OM
}

node "Experiment / user process" {
    [Experiment] as Exp
    [TestbedProxy] as TBP
    [ServiceProxy\n(CameraProxy, DM proxy, ...)] as SP
    [LogWriter / LogTerminal] as LogObs
}

database "Shared memory" {
    [DataStream ring buffers\n+ Events] as SHM
}

Cfg --> TB : services, ports,\nsafety, simulation
TB --> Svc1 : spawn subprocess\n(--id --port --testbed_port)
TB --> Svc2 : spawn subprocess
Svc1 --> TB : RegisterService\n+ heartbeats
Svc2 --> TB : RegisterService

Exp --> TBP : get_service(...)
TBP --> TB : ZMQ requests\n(start/stop service, info, config)
TBP --> SP : create proxy\n(interface from entry points)
SP --> Srv1 : ZMQ request/reply\n(properties, commands)
Srv1 --> Svc1 : dispatch to\nhandlers

Svc1 --> SHM : SubmitFrame()
SP --> SHM : GetFrame() /\nGetNextFrame()
Svc2 --> SHM : simulated camera\nimages, DM state
OM --> Svc2 : propagated wavefronts

Svc1 --> LogDist : log messages\n(ingress port)
Svc2 --> LogDist
Exp --> LogDist : LogForwarder
LogDist --> LogObs : egress port
Svc1 --> TraceDist : trace events

note bottom of SHM
  Device data never travels through the
  testbed server: it flows directly
  between processes via shared memory.
end note

@enduml
